Privacy Policy — Paw Rush: Animal Race & Climb
Last updated: 29 July 2026 · Developer: Vainsteel Studios · Contact: vainsteelstudios@gmail.com

This Privacy Policy explains how the mobile game Paw Rush: Animal Race & Climb ("the App", "we", "us") handles information. We designed the App to be privacy-friendly: we do not ask you to create an account, and we do not collect your name, email, phone number, or precise location.

1. Information We Do Not Collect
No sign-up, no account, no login.
No name, email address, phone number, or contacts.
No precise (GPS) location.
No photos, microphone, or camera access.
2. Data Stored On Your Device
Your game progress — coins, unlocked characters, upgrades, best times, achievements, daily-quest status, settings (sound, music, vibration, language), and your ghost/time-trial records — is stored locally on your device only (in the app's local storage). It is not uploaded to us and is removed if you clear the app data or uninstall the App. You can erase it any time from the in-game Settings → "Reset All Data".

3. Advertising (Google AdMob)
The App shows advertisements through Google AdMob (banner, interstitial, and optional rewarded ads). To serve and measure ads, Google and its partners may collect and process certain information, which can include: a device advertising identifier, IP address, general (coarse) location derived from IP, device type and settings, and ad-interaction data. This information is used for ad delivery, frequency capping, measurement, and (where permitted) personalization.

Where required (e.g., EEA/UK), the App presents a consent request (Google User Messaging Platform) before personalized ads are used.
You can reset or limit your advertising identifier in your device settings (Settings → Google → Ads).
Google's handling of this data is described in Google Privacy & Terms and the AdMob documentation.
Rewarded ads are always optional — you choose to watch them for in-game bonuses.

4. Purchases (Google Play Billing)
The App offers an optional one-time in-app purchase (the "Supporter Pack") which removes ads and unlocks extra content. Purchases are processed by Google Play. We do not receive or store your payment card details; Google handles the transaction. See the Google Play privacy information.

5. Children
The App is family-friendly and may appeal to children. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. Advertising is configured to request non-personalized/child-appropriate treatment where applicable, consistent with Google Play's Families policy and applicable law (e.g., COPPA/GDPR-K). If you believe a child has provided personal information, contact us and we will address it.

6. Data Sharing
We do not sell your personal information. Information described above is processed by our service providers (Google AdMob, Google Play) solely to operate ads and purchases as described.

7. Security & Retention
Game data stays on your device and is retained until you clear app data or uninstall. Advertising and purchase data are retained by the respective providers per their policies.

8. Your Choices
Reset all local game data in-app: Settings → "Reset All Data".
Reset/limit your advertising ID in device settings.
Buy the Supporter Pack to remove ads.
Manage consent (where shown) via the in-app consent prompt.
9. Changes
We may update this policy as the App evolves. Material changes will be reflected here with a new "Last updated" date.

10. Contact
Questions about this policy: vainsteelstudios@gmail.com (Vainsteel Studios).
